---
description: Public thingd repository boundary and validation
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/agent-implementation-guide.md` before work.

- Keep engine, SDK, CLI, MCP/REST, API specs, self-hosting, and public docs in
  this repository.
- Keep Cloud auth, billing, tenancy, hosted operations, private planning, and
  internal audits out of this repository.
- Preserve unrelated dirty changes.
- Do not commit, push, deploy, file issues, or contact external systems without
  explicit user authorization.
- Run `pnpm check:docs` before handoff for documentation changes.
